补服。","quote_sha256":"77469135da3c00cb2bce65478f6bad74d03dfa17968640d97d985a02cef3555c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_dose"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂薄膜衣片QD×52周双盲双模拟","quote_sha256":"30e9f26c44ae53d631907be2c36fff51ed4bf9dfcc635b76beacde2b3ae761f7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"给药途径：口服","quote_sha256":"404b058b755608a73d13b54521a28c02b129df449774d0671b1c3f8b8a5ce42c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_route"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"剂型：口服固体制剂","quote_sha256":"2c22ee80756bfd178af43cee3c8a0a1b4058aaecb83d264b4107972a334b5bf4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_form"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"主要终点：治疗第52周IPSS总评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"5559e0fbbd077e8e70a2dc5aa1f07f25d192927261892a235debd05ba27ae71c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"治疗策略（treatment policy）：mITT人群第52周IPSS总评分较基线的变化，不因依从性、合并BPH用药或脱落改变归属；缺失值主分析采用MMRM。","quote_sha256":"488833ef9a0ab4b300179c2cbb097a199b1e955231167830a594234b7a1f24e0","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_estimand"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"TEAE/SAE发生率与严重程度；实验室、心电图与生命体征；性功能相关AE（射精功能障碍、性欲减退）","quote_sha256":"a2bd6c6a75d4f174a8eb7f9ba36f47b11cb49e8a3323c8a630f159ae98122d68","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_safety"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"筛选期（最长6周）；双盲治疗期（52周，每日口服一次）；安全性随访（末次给药后4周）","quote_sha256":"6853ec69b4e67ea2604e1f26a650ee19e8069b0aa73a232f2b266d2d0eafb556","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_periods"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"治疗期每12周访视（V1-V5）：IPSS/QoL、给药依从性、AE；第26与52周加测尿流率与PVR；安全性随访（末次给药后4周）。","quote_sha256":"c6c5f315d914c371a58f79478995d84efa74ecc6fc7da379486f8f49105232a6","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_visits"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"假设第52周IPSS较基线变化组间差异2.0分（SD 5.0），α=0.05双侧、把握度90%，每组290例可评价；按20%脱落率入组726例（每组363例）。","quote_sha256":"a614ad49604f64d0a6b1dc2f7b9bb1abc98cfd8f78605df604976f42b255c4e8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_samplesize"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"DMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"9967a9a75297ced2326ab733fa3b16934acdef641fa765dd50c1cd58219f4aa5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_dmc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"自适应设计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c71bda4d6101542f8a3c2bb0087631982c72176be9ca9a2526dc2c08ed0ee52a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_adaptive"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"31ef70e7f5cd03d6c17b90802e7352c6e81b5fdc853989b74ea1499901f514a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_interim"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"SRC是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c313c8ef9ed6e2107818bc5d2c8caa143c85bf55ac51060b4e8cc53c959daf6e","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_src"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_a_sec4_title","ev_b_title","ev_b_design","ev_b_population","ev_b_inclusion","ev_b_exclusion","ev_b_washout","ev_b_dose","ev_b_placebo","ev_b_route","ev_b_form","ev_b_primary","ev_b_estimand","ev_b_safety","ev_b_periods","ev_b_visits","ev_b_samplesize","ev_b_dmc","ev_b_adaptive","ev_b_interim","ev_b_src"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":20},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究为随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心III期确证性研究，在中国开展。目标研究人群为50-85岁良性前列腺增生伴中重度下尿路症状的男性患者，IPSS总评分≥13分且QoL≥3分，前列腺体积30-80mL，筛选前未接受BPH手术治疗，未使用α1阻滞剂、5α还原酶抑制剂或已停用足够洗脱期；洗脱要求为α1阻滞剂与抗毒蕈碱类药物停用≥4周，5α还原酶抑制剂停用≥12周。主要排除标准包括前列腺癌病史或PSA>4.0 ng/mL且需进一步排查、神经源性膀胱或膀胱出口梗阻以外原因所致LUTS、既往盆腔放疗或尿道手术史，以及eGFR<30、肝功能显著异常（ALT/AST>2×ULN）、未控制的高血压或糖尿病。受试者按1:1比例随机分配至R3A-BPH101 50mg组或安慰剂组：R3A-BPH101组口服50mg薄膜衣片，每日一次，整片吞服，连续52周，漏服当日不补服；安慰剂组口服安慰剂薄膜衣片，每日一次，连续52周，采用双盲双模拟设计；治疗期间维持稳定基础护理与定期前列腺监测。主要终点为治疗第52周IPSS总评分较基线的变化，估计目标采用治疗策略，在mITT人群中进行主分析，缺失值主分析采用MMRM。安全性评价包括TEAE/SAE发生率与严重程度、实验室检查、心电图与生命体征，以及性功能相关AE（射精功能障碍、性欲减退）。研究时期包括筛选期（最长6周）、双盲治疗期（52周，每日口服一次）及安全性随访（末次给药后4周）；治疗期每12周访视一次，第26周与第52周加测尿流率与残余尿量。样本量方面，假设第52周IPSS较基线变化组间差异2.0分（SD 5.0），α=0.05双侧、把握度90%，每组290例可评价，按20%脱落率计划入组726例（每组363例）。研究设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC），不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计与期中分析，亦不计划设置SRC。","rationale":"正文依据已确认研究事实写入总体设计、目标人群与关键入排、洗脱要求、试验干预与安慰剂双盲双模拟、剂量与给药周期、主要终点与估计目标、安全性评价、研究时期与访视安排、样本量与把握度、DMC设置及未计划的自适应/期中设计。医学作者需在相应章节核定随机化实施细节与关键次要终点清单；关键次要终点清单的缺失不影响本章节设计层面正文的完整性。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（研究设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（α、主要终点、估计目标、期中分析、样本量、计划入组）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_eb287e2ce57ed2cf","section_number":"4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a7a27e32dfeb8cbec16b2e8d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260929212032_6550cbce","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_dcedb3760172c9fc:full-draft:a7a27e32dfeb8cbec16b2e8d","quote":"章节标题=总体设计","quote_sha256":"48c9b7caeed69a16d2e4455c930907ff0c05eb8114fc386cf74f087f304b8fa5","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a7a27e32dfeb8cbec16b2e8d","span_id":"ev_a_sec41_title"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_dcedb3760172c9fc:full-draft:a7a27e32dfeb8cbec16b2e8d","quote":"当前正文=随机化；双盲；安慰剂对照；平行组；多中心；设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC）","quote_sha256":"ee99cbdf7edb2a84894e000f80aafd330aaf429cb3a9b51e5c77f50417e804fb","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a7a27e32dfeb8cbec16b2e8d","span_id":"ev_a_sec41_body"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"总体研究设计：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心III期确证性研究","quote_sha256":"b54023d287ba13d7e981a0107b17ac83e4cdc7d00339373c8b4b93062e32b7df","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_design"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"分配模型：平行组","quote_sha256":"5e70b0bc5b3a55e709991ab54941ee36f3a7e04e4d8d776ac74298515efc5ab1","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_alloc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"中心模式：多中心","quote_sha256":"2cfa68bc992967c797bbd3113b5e0d0844d660a2050095a31f08358c5e40311f","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_center"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"安慰剂薄膜衣片QD×52周双盲双模拟","quote_sha256":"30e9f26c44ae53d631907be2c36fff51ed4bf9dfcc635b76beacde2b3ae761f7","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_placebo"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"主要终点：治疗第52周IPSS总评分较基线的变化。","quote_sha256":"5559e0fbbd077e8e70a2dc5aa1f07f25d192927261892a235debd05ba27ae71c","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_primary"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"DMC是否计划：是","quote_sha256":"9967a9a75297ced2326ab733fa3b16934acdef641fa765dd50c1cd58219f4aa5","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_dmc"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"自适应设计是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"c71bda4d6101542f8a3c2bb0087631982c72176be9ca9a2526dc2c08ed0ee52a","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_adaptive"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:revision:4","quote":"期中分析是否计划：否","quote_sha256":"31ef70e7f5cd03d6c17b90802e7352c6e81b5fdc853989b74ea1499901f514a4","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","span_id":"ev_b_interim"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["ev_a_sec41_title","ev_a_sec41_body","ev_b_design","ev_b_alloc","ev_b_center","ev_b_placebo","ev_b_primary","ev_b_dmc","ev_b_adaptive","ev_b_interim"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":8},"gap_items":[],"heading":"总体设计","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计，为III期确证性研究，在中国开展。受试者按1:1比例随机分配至R3A-BPH101 50mg组或安慰剂组，接受每日一次口服治疗，连续52周；安慰剂组使用匹配的安慰剂薄膜衣片，研究采用双盲双模拟设计。研究设置独立数据监查委员会（DMC），不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计与期中分析。主要疗效比较为R3A-BPH101 50mg组与安慰剂组第52周IPSS总评分较基线的变化。","rationale":"正文仅使用已确认的总体设计要素：随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心、双盲双模拟与DMC设置，以及不计划自适应设计、样本量再估计和期中分析；主要疗效比较取自已确认的主要终点。随机化实施方法、盲态范围与DMC运行方式未在本章节展开，需由医学作者在相应后续章节和项目文件中核定。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（总体设计）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。","本节提及高影响设计信息（期中分析、样本量）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_05d15687718a6a82","section_number":"4.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:a7a27e32dfeb8cbec16b2e8d","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_c8f522c6663608590875:r4:41c849f3ebaa5aa3","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a5f4a227d6404a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:abb423601f76d0","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:a3cf98aab983c7","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:21fb7445eed9f6","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"d3caa6434189dca3e1a1202d2141a8bfb60be11babe834540aad830cd883c315","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87b350249cad_dcedb3760172c9fc:full-draft:a7a27e32dfeb8cbec16b2e8d","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:a7a27e32dfeb8cbec16b2e8d","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:f94942df2b54539a7bb61ed3d77887d5d31e6dfd7ae9f01e5fbb9073f52d3970:a7a27e32dfeb8cbec16b2e8d","text_sha256":"d3caa6434189dca3e1a1202d2141a8bfb60be11babe834540aad830cd883c315"},{"content_sha256